---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /events/
variant: events
title: "What's on this Fall"
description: "Fall events in St. Catharines and the Niagara Benchlands — music festivals, live theatre, harvest festivals, family events and so much more."
---
{% set heroTitle = "What's on this Fall" %}
{% set heroSub = "Music festivals, live theatre, family events and so much more" %}
{% set heroCtaLabel = "Browse the events" %}
{% set heroCtaHref = "#events" %}
{% set heroSlot = "EVENTS" %}
{% set heroAlt = "A crowd at an evening concert in Montebello Park under a purple sky" %}
{% include "partials/hero.njk" %}

<section class="section" id="events" data-module="events">
  <div class="wrap">
    {# DRAFT — client to approve: events explainer for visitors + AI/search #}
    <div class="section__head" style="max-width:62ch">
      <p>Fall events here happen where the season does: in vineyards, orchards, conservation areas and small-town main streets across St. Catharines and the Niagara Benchlands. Expect harvest festivals with local food and wine, live music indoors and out, studio tours, markets, and family days on working farms. Most run rain or shine — dress in layers, expect grass and gravel underfoot at outdoor venues, and check each listing for dates and tickets. <em class="draft-mark">[DRAFT — client to approve]</em></p>
    </div>
    {% set slotKey = "EVENTS" %}
    {% set slotCells = 12 %}
    {% include "partials/widget-slot.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--warm" id="faq" data-module="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section__head"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div>
    {% if faq and faq.length %}
    {# Client-authorized FAQ, verbatim from wanderniagara.com's events guide (see _data/faq.js) #}
    <div class="faq">
      {% for qa in faq %}
      <details{% if loop.first %} open{% endif %}>
        <summary>{{ qa.q }}</summary>
        <div class="faq__a">{{ qa.a | safe }}</div>
      </details>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    {% set slotKey = "FAQ_CONTENT" %}
    {% set slotCells = 3 %}
    {% include "partials/widget-slot.njk" %}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/page-tail.njk" %}

{# WebPage structured data for AI/search discoverability (JSON-LD is valid in <body>) #}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "What's on this Fall — {{ site.name }}",
  "description": {{ description | dump | safe }},
  "url": "{{ site.url }}{{ page.url }}",
  "isPartOf": { "@type": "WebSite", "name": "{{ site.name }}", "url": "{{ site.url }}" },
  "about": { "@type": "Place", "name": "St. Catharines and the Niagara Benchlands, Ontario" }
}
</script>
{% if faq and faq.length %}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {% for qa in faq %}{
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": {{ qa.q | dump | safe }},
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": {{ (qa.a | striptags) | dump | safe }} }
    }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>
{% endif %}
